# Local browser inspection artifacts.
.playwright-mcp/

# Local UI/UX score-loop capture artifacts.
#
# Deny by default, then re-admit only scorecard.md, which is retained as ADR-0002 line 70
# verification evidence. The previous rule ignored *.png alone, so any other capture landing here --
# an .html snapshot, a .json trace, a console log -- was committable. These captures are taken
# against the live database: the sibling .playwright-mcp/ directory, which is ignored outright,
# holds real customer identifiers in 23 non-image files, so that was a live disclosure path.
#
# The second line is load-bearing: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded,
# so directories have to be re-admitted before scorecard.md can be.
ux-loop-artifacts/**
!ux-loop-artifacts/**/
!ux-loop-artifacts/**/scorecard.md
